          "name": "List report CSV files that are available for download for this course.",
          "request": {
            "name": "List report CSV files that are available for download for this course.",
            "description": {
              "content": "**Use Cases**\n\nLists reports available for download\n\n**Example Requests**:\n\n    GET /api/instructor/v1/reports/{course_id}\n\n**Response Values**\n```json\n{\n    \"downloads\": [\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://1.mock.url\",\n            \"link\": \"<a href=\"https://1.mock.url\">mock_file_name_1</a>\",\n            \"name\": \"mock_file_name_1\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\nThe report name will depend on the type of report generated. For example a\nproblem responses report for an entire course might be called:\n\n    edX_DemoX_Demo_Course_student_state_from_block-v1_edX+DemoX+Demo_Course+type@course+block@course_2021-04-30-0918.csv",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "instructor",
                "v1",
                "reports",
                ":course_id"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "report_name",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Filter results to only return details of for the report with the specified name."
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "course_id",
                  "description": "(Required) ID for the course whose reports need to be listed."
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": null
