        {
          "id": "0926dd48-4ec3-470b-b809-5838273604c3",
          "name": "List instructor tasks filtered by `course_id`.",
          "request": {
            "name": "List instructor tasks filtered by `course_id`.",
            "description": {
              "content": "**Use Cases**\n\nLists currently running instructor tasks\n\n**Parameters**\n   - With no arguments, lists running tasks.\n   - `problem_location_str` lists task history for problem\n   - `problem_location_str` and `unique_student_identifier` lists task\n       history for problem AND student (intersection)\n\n**Example Requests**:\n\n    GET /courses/{course_id}/instructor/api/v0/tasks\n\n**Response Values**\n```json\n    {\n      \"tasks\": [\n        {\n          \"status\": \"Incomplete\",\n          \"task_type\": \"grade_problems\",\n          \"task_id\": \"2519ff31-22d9-4a62-91e2-55495895b355\",\n          \"created\": \"2019-01-15T18:00:15.902470+00:00\",\n          \"task_input\": \"{}\",\n          \"duration_sec\": \"unknown\",\n          \"task_message\": \"No status information available\",\n          \"requester\": \"staff\",\n          \"task_state\": \"PROGRESS\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n```",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "instructor",
                "v1",
                "tasks",
                ":course_id"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "problem_location_str",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Filter instructor tasks to this problem location."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "unique_student_identifier",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Filter tasks to a singe problem and a single student. Must be used in combination with `problem_location_str`."
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "course_id",
                  "description": "(Required) ID for the course whose tasks need to be listed."
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": null
          },
